  (text "=== MCU: STM32G041K6U6 ===" (at 78.74 47.63 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "=== INPUTS ===" (at 10.16 46.99 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "=== BRAKE FET CIRCUIT ===" (at 121.92 46.99 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "=== KEEP-ALIVE FET CIRCUIT ===" (at 121.92 93.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "=== TRACK CONNECTORS ===" (at 218.44 84.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "=== SWD DEBUG / FLASH HEADER (J10) ===" (at 116.84 48.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Pin 1: SWDIO (PA13)  Pin 2: SWDCLK (PA14)\nPin 3: GND            Pin 4: +3.3V (optional)\n2.54mm 4-pin header. Match your ST-Link V2/V3 pinout." (at 116.84 50.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "=== UART DEBUG / BOOTLOADER (J11) ===" (at 116.84 78.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Pin 1: TX PA9  (-> RX of USB-UART adapter)\nPin 2: RX PA10 (-> TX of USB-UART adapter)\nPin 3: GND\n115200 8N1, 3.3V logic. Telemetry CSV at 100ms interval.\nAlso used by ROM bootloader (hold BOOT0 + press NRST)." (at 116.84 81.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "=== BOOT0 BUTTON (J12) ===" (at 33.02 138.43 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "J12: momentary button PB8/BOOT0 to 3.3V\nHold J12 + press J13 NRST = ROM bootloader entry\nFlash via J11 UART: stm32flash -w aart_brake.bin /dev/ttyUSB0" (at 33.02 141.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "=== NRST BUTTON (J13) ===" (at 66.04 138.43 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "J13: momentary button NRST to GND\nPress while holding J12 BOOT0 to enter bootloader.\nRelease J13 first, then release J12." (at 66.04 141.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "SAFE DEFAULT:\nR2 (10k) on GD1 input pulls HIGH when MCU off\n=> Q1 ON => motor dead-shorted = safe" (at 121.92 55.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "Q1: N-ch low-side brake FET\nTIM3_CH1 INVERTED polarity\nCCR=0 => FET ON => dead short\nCCR=2720 => ~8ohm\nCCR=3199 => FET OFF" (at 185.42 82.55 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "Q2: P-ch high-side keep-alive FET\nTIM3_CH2 normal polarity\nCCR=0 => FET OFF\nCCR=400 => ~2V injected at 16V rail" (at 185.42 120.65 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "D4: MODE C ESSENTIAL\nBlocks reverse current into Q2\nwhen Q1 hard-brakes the track.\nOmit on mode A/B-only boards." (at 210.82 132.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "POT MAPPING (all modes):\nCCW => min brake (~8 ohm)\nCW  => max brake (dead short)\nMode A: centre = dead short\n        CW past centre = positive anti-brake 0-2V" (at 10.16 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "COMPONENT LIST (Rev 9):\nU1  STM32G041K6U6  QFN-32\nU2  AMS1117-3.3    SOT-223\nGD1 UCC27524       SOT-23-5  (brake gate driver)\nGD2 UCC27524       SOT-23-5  (keep-alive gate driver)\nQ1  IRLB3034       D2PAK     (N-ch brake FET)\nQ2  IRF9Z34N       D2PAK     (P-ch keep-alive FET)\nD1  P6KE18CA       SMB       (TVS BIDIRECTIONAL - CA suffix essential)\nD2  SS310          SMB       (Q1 catch - 100V required)\nD3  SS310          SMB       (Q2 catch - 100V required)\nD4  MBRS360/SS54   SMB       (mode C series - most stressed diode)\nD5  LED Red        0805      (status LED)\nF1  500mA-1A polyfuse  1812  (WHITE rail MCU supply ONLY)\nC1  10uF 0805  C2  100nF 0402  (LDO in)\nC3  10uF 0805  C4  100nF 0402  (LDO out)\nC5-C7  100nF/100nF/4u7 0402  (MCU decouple)\nR1  10k (NRST)  R2  10k (safe default on GD1 INPUT)\nR3  10R (Q1 gate)  R4  10R (Q2 gate)\nR5  10k (pot ref)  R6  10k (btn pullup)  R7  1k (btn series)\nR8  18k  R9  4k7  (WHITE sense)  R10  22k  R11  4k7  (BLACK sense)\nR12 330R (LED)\nJ1-J6   4mm banana sockets (track+ctrl WHITE/BLACK/RED)\nJ7  3-pin 2.54mm (mode toggle)\nJ8  2-pin 2.54mm (capture button)\nJ9  2-pin 4mm (track output)\nJ10 4-pin 2.54mm (SWD: SWDIO/SWDCLK/GND/+3V3)\nJ11 3-pin 2.54mm (UART: TX/RX/GND)\nJ12 2-pin 2.54mm (BOOT0 button)\nJ13 2-pin 2.54mm (NRST button)" (at 10.16 166.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "PLACEMENT GUIDE:\nTop-left:    Power (J1 rail, F1, D1, U2, C1-C4)\nTop-centre:  SWD J10 | UART J11\nLeft-mid:    Inputs (pot, toggle, capture btn, dividers)\nBelow-left:  BOOT0 J12 | NRST J13\nCentre:      MCU U1, C5-C7, R1\nRight-upper: Brake FET (GD1, R2, R3, Q1, D2)\nRight-lower: Keep-alive FET (GD2, R4, Q2, D3, D4)\nFar-right:   Track banana J1-J6\nBelow MCU:   Status LED R12 D5\nR2 pull-up: on GD1 INA input - NOT on Q1 gate" (at 10.16 210.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
)
